"之书》第 III 到 VI 部分给出了完整的证明、定义和参考文献。"

#: ../../index.rst:239
msgid ""
"Theorem 1 (Linear-time inspection with a byte-class Aho-Corasick "
"automaton)"
msgstr "定理 1（字节类 Aho-Corasick 自动机的线性时间检查）"

#: ../../index.rst:241
msgid ""
"Let :math:`\\mathcal{P}` be a set of patterns of total length :math:`m` "
"whose bytes fall into :math:`c \\le 256` classes, and let a text have "
"length :math:`M`. Sibuna builds the automaton in :math:`O(mc)` time and "
"space and reports whether any pattern occurs in the text in :math:`O(M)` "
"time, with one dependent table load per input byte, independent of the "
"number of patterns. No input can make it backtrack."
msgstr ""
"设 :math:`\\mathcal{P}` 是总长度为 :math:`m` 的模式集合，其字节分为 :math:`c \\le 256` "
"个类，文本长度为 :math:`M`。Sibuna 以 :math:`O(mc)` 的时间和空间构建自动机，并在 :math:`O(M)` "
"时间内报告文本中是否出现任一模式；每个输入字节只需一次相互依赖的表读取，与模式数量无关。任何输入都无法使它回溯。"

#: ../../index.rst:243
msgid ""
"*Proof sketch.* The automaton of Aho and Corasick scans a text once after "
"building a trie with failure links. Sibuna folds the failure links into "
"the transition table at build time, so each input byte is one transition "
"and no failure chain is ever followed. A byte class is a byte that occurs "
"in some pattern, with both cases of a letter in one class, or the single "
"class of all other bytes; a row of the table therefore has :math:`c` "
"entries instead of 256. Match states are numbered after all other states, "
"so detecting a match is one comparison."
msgstr ""
"*证明概要。* Aho 和 Corasick 的自动机先构建带失败链接的字典树，然后只扫描文本一遍。Sibuna "
"在构建时把失败链接折叠进转移表，因此每个输入字节只是一次转移，从不沿失败链前进。一个字节类要么是某个模式中出现的字节（字母的大小写归入同一类），要么是由其余所有字节组成的那一个类；因此表的每一行只有 "
":math:`c` 个条目，而不是 256 个。匹配状态排在所有其他状态之后编号，因此检测匹配只需一次比较。"

#: ../../index.rst:245
msgid ""
"*Measurement.* On 40 bot signatures the automaton takes 55.7 ns against "
"763.0 ns for sequential substring search with the same patterns and "
"any-match semantics, 13.7 times faster. With byte classes the whole bot "
"signature table takes 42,244 bytes [#automaton]_."
msgstr ""
"*测量。* 在 40 条机器人签名上，自动机耗时 55.7 ns；使用相同模式、同样采用任一匹配语义的顺序子串搜索耗时 763.0 ns，自动机快 "
"13.7 倍。借助字节类，整张机器人签名表只占 42,244 字节 [#automaton]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:247
msgid "Theorem 2 (The GCRA interval bound)"
msgstr "定理 2（GCRA 区间界）"

#: ../../index.rst:249
msgid ""
"Fix a limit of :math:`N` requests per window :math:`W`, with emission "
"interval :math:`T = \\max(1, \\lceil W/N \\rceil)` and burst tolerance "
":math:`\\tau = (N-1)T`. A client keeps one theoretical arrival time "
":math:`\\mathrm{TAT}`. An arrival at time :math:`t` conforms if and only "
"if :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} \\le t + \\tau`, after which :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} "
"\\leftarrow \\max(\\mathrm{TAT}, t) + T`. Then any interval of length "
":math:`L` that begins with a conforming arrival contains at most :math:`N "
"+ \\lfloor L/T \\rfloor` conforming arrivals."
msgstr ""
"固定每个窗口 :math:`W` 内 :math:`N` 个请求的限制，发射间隔 :math:`T = \\max(1, \\lceil W/N "
"\\rceil)`，突发容限 :math:`\\tau = (N-1)T`。每个客户端保存一个理论到达时间 "
":math:`\\mathrm{TAT}`。时刻 :math:`t` 的一次到达是合规的，当且仅当 :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} "
"\\le t + \\tau`，此后 :math:`\\mathrm{TAT} \\leftarrow \\max(\\mathrm{TAT}, "
"t) + T`。那么，任何以一次合规到达开始、长度为 :math:`L` 的区间，至多包含 :math:`N + \\lfloor L/T "
"\\rfloor` 次合规到达。"

#: ../../index.rst:251
msgid ""
"*Proof sketch.* Number the conforming arrivals :math:`1, \\dots, k` at "
"times :math:`t_1 \\le \\dots \\le t_k`. Each conforming arrival raises "
"the TAT by at least :math:`T`, so after the :math:`j`-th one "
":math:`\\mathrm{TAT}_j \\ge t_1 + jT`. Arrival :math:`k` conformed, so "
":math:`\\mathrm{TAT}_{k-1} \\le t_k + \\tau \\le t_1 + L + \\tau`. "
"Together these give :math:`(k-1)T \\le L + (N-1)T`, so :math:`k \\le N + "
"L/T`, and :math:`k` is a whole number."
msgstr ""
"*证明概要。* 把合规到达依次编号为 :math:`1, \\dots, k`，时刻为 :math:`t_1 \\le \\dots \\le "
"t_k`。每次合规到达至少把 TAT 提高 :math:`T`，因此第 :math:`j` 次之后 :math:`\\mathrm{TAT}_j "
"\\ge t_1 + jT`。第 :math:`k` 次到达是合规的，因此 :math:`\\mathrm{TAT}_{k-1} \\le t_k "
"+ \\tau \\le t_1 + L + \\tau`。两式合起来得到 :math:`(k-1)T \\le L + (N-1)T`，即 "
":math:`k \\le N + L/T`，而 :math:`k` 是整数。"

#: ../../index.rst:253
msgid ""
"*Implementation.* The state of a client is one 16-byte cell, with no "
"per-request history and no fixed-window boundary effect. The 16 shards "
"share ``--rate-table-cells`` cells (262,144 by default, 4 MiB), placed by "
"a keyed hash, and a drained cell is reclaimed in place without a sweeper. "
"A check on a client whose hash the daemon has already computed takes 6.2 "
"ns [#gcra]_."
msgstr ""
"*实现。* 一个客户端的状态是一个 16 字节的单元，没有逐请求的历史，也没有固定窗口的边界效应。16 个分片共用 "
"``--rate-table-cells`` 个单元（默认 262,144 个，4 "
"MiB），按带密钥哈希放置；排空的单元就地回收，无需清扫线程。对守护进程已经算好哈希的客户端做一次检查，耗时 6.2 ns [#gcra]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:255
msgid "Theorem 3 (State grows only with paid work)"
msgstr "定理 3（状态只随付出的工作增长）"

#: ../../index.rst:257
msgid ""
"Let :math:`S` be the set of challenge tags the daemon remembers. A tag "
"enters :math:`S` only after a valid proof for its challenge was accepted, "
"and it leaves when the challenge expires. If :math:`r` bounds the rate of "
"accepted distinct solutions over one challenge lifetime, then :math:`|S| "
"\\le r \\cdot \\mathrm{TTL}`. A challenge that was fetched but not solved "
"occupies no memory."
msgstr ""
"设 :math:`S` 是守护进程记住的挑战标签集合。一个标签只有在其挑战的有效证明被接受之后才进入 :math:`S`，并在挑战过期时离开。若 "
":math:`r` 是一个挑战有效期内被接受的不同解答的速率上界，则 :math:`|S| \\le r \\cdot "
"\\mathrm{TTL}`。已获取但未求解的挑战不占用任何内存。"

#: ../../index.rst:259
msgid ""
"*Proof sketch.* A challenge identifier is a self-authenticating record: "
"version, algorithm, difficulty, opening count, issue time, the client's "
"keyed fingerprint, a nonce derived by a pseudorandom function, and the "
"hash of the rule that demanded it, 36 bytes followed by a 16-byte "
"keyed-BLAKE3 tag, 70 characters in URL-safe base64. Issuing one writes "
"nothing. Verification checks the tag in constant time, then the age and "
"the client binding, then the proof, and only then inserts the tag into "
"the spent set. With BLAKE3 in keyed mode modelled as a pseudorandom "
"function, an adversary making :math:`q` verification queries forges a tag "
"with probability at most :math:`q \\cdot 2^{-128}` plus the PRF advantage."
msgstr ""
"*证明概要。* 挑战标识符是一条自认证记录：版本、算法、难度、揭示数、签发时间、客户端的带密钥指纹、由伪随机函数派生的 "
"nonce，以及要求这次挑战的规则的哈希，共 36 字节，后跟 16 字节的带密钥 BLAKE3 标签，用 URL 安全的 base64 编码为 "
"70 个字符。签发挑战不写入任何内容。验证时先以常量时间检查标签，再检查时效和客户端绑定，然后检查证明，最后才把标签插入已用集合。把带密钥模式的 "
"BLAKE3 建模为伪随机函数时，发起 :math:`q` 次验证查询的对手伪造标签的概率至多为 :math:`q \\cdot "
"2^{-128}` 加上 PRF 优势。"

#: ../../index.rst:261
msgid ""
"*Implementation.* The spent set is 16 shards of Robin Hood open "
"addressing. An expired entry may be overwritten in place only by a key at "
"least as far from its home slot, or a later lookup could stop early and "
"miss a live tag; with that rule no sweeper thread is needed, and a "
"refused insertion never evicts a live tag. A spend and a lookup together "
"take 21.0 ns [#spent]_."
msgstr ""
"*实现。* 已用集合由 16 个采用 Robin Hood "
"开放寻址的分片组成。一个过期条目只能被距其原位槽至少同样远的键就地覆盖，否则后续查找可能提前停止而漏掉仍然有效的标签；有了这条规则，就不需要清扫线程，而且被拒绝的插入从不驱逐有效标签。一次花费加一次查找共耗时 "
"21.0 ns [#spent]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:263
msgid "The Semantic Firewall"
msgstr "语义防火墙"

#: ../../index.rst:266
msgid ""
"Shield inspects the path, the query, the User-Agent, the headers that are "
"not structural, and the first 8 KiB of the body. Its first version taught "
"us a lesson. It matched a flat list of substrings against every header, "
"the list contained ``/*``, and every browser sends ``Accept: "
"text/html,...,*/*;q=0.8``. Every real browser was classified as SQL "
"injection. Since then a detector may fire only on *structure*, and a test "
"passes a complete Chrome request through the engine and requires it to "
"come out clean [#waf]_."
msgstr ""
"Shield 检查路径、查询、User-Agent、非结构性的请求头，以及请求体的前 8 "
"KiB。它的第一个版本给了我们一个教训。那个版本把一张扁平的子串列表与每个请求头逐一匹配，列表中有 ``/*``，而每个浏览器都会发送 "
"``Accept: text/html,...,*/*;q=0.8``。结果，每个真实的浏览器都被判为 SQL 注入。从那以后，检测器只能依据 "
"*结构* 触发，并且有一项测试会让一个完整的 Chrome 请求通过引擎，要求它干净地通过 [#waf]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:268
msgid "Inspection has four stages, each linear in the field."
msgstr "检查分为四个阶段，每个阶段的耗时都与字段长度成线性关系。"

#: ../../index.rst:270
msgid ""
"*A byte-class pre-scan.* One pass with a 256-entry table records which "
"classes of byte occur: quotes, ``=``, ``<``, shell separators, ``%``, NUL "
"and the triggers of canonicalisation. Every later detector consults these "
"classes instead of rescanning, so a field without a quote or an equals "
"sign never enters the SQL tokenizer."
msgstr ""
"*字节类预扫描。* 用一张 256 项的表扫描一遍，记录出现了哪些类别的字节：引号、``=``、``<``、shell "
"分隔符、``%``、NUL，以及触发规范化的字节。后续每个检测器都查询这些类别，而不是重新扫描，因此不含引号或等号的字段永远不会进入 SQL "
"分词器。"

#: ../../index.rst:271
msgid ""
"*A tagged signature automaton.* All strong signatures of every category "
"live in one automaton (Theorem 1). A hit is a terminal denial named "
"``waf:sqli``, ``waf:xss``, ``waf:path-traversal`` or ``waf:rce``."
msgstr ""
"*带标签的签名自动机。* 所有类别的全部强签名都放在同一个自动机中（定理 1）。一次命中就是终局性的拒绝，名为 "
"``waf:sqli``、``waf:xss``、``waf:path-traversal`` 或 ``waf:rce``。"

#: ../../index.rst:272
msgid ""
"*Structural tokenizers.* The SQL tokenizer looks up each short word in a "
"keyword table and checks ``literal = literal`` tautologies after ``or`` "
"and ``and``; otherwise a quote is mandatory and the evidence must reach a "
"small score. The phrase \"it's a group order from the shop\" scores 3 and "
"passes. Cross-site scripting requires a tag that can host script together "
"with an event-handler attribute in attribute position, and command "
"injection requires a separator followed by a command name that is not an "
"assignment, so ``a=1&id=5`` is a parameter, not a command."
msgstr ""
"*结构化分词器。* SQL 分词器在关键字表中查找每个短词，并检查 ``or`` 和 ``and`` 之后形如 ``literal = "
"literal`` 的恒真式；否则，必须出现引号，并且证据的分数要达到一个不高的阈值。短语 “it's a group order from "
"the shop” 得 3 "
"分，可以通过。跨站脚本要求出现一个能承载脚本的标签，并在属性位置上带有事件处理属性；命令注入要求一个分隔符后跟一个不是赋值的命令名，因此 "
"``a=1&id=5`` 是参数，而不是命令。"

#: ../../index.rst:273
msgid ""
"*Canonicalisation.* A field with percent escapes, comment openers, JSON "
"or HTML escapes, or collapsible white space is decoded and inspected "
"again, so ``1%27/**/UnIoN/**/SeLeCt`` and ``%252e%252e/`` collapse onto "
"the raw signatures."
msgstr ""
"*规范化。* 含有百分号转义、注释开头、JSON 或 HTML 转义，或可折叠空白的字段，会被解码后再检查一次，因此 "
"``1%27/**/UnIoN/**/SeLeCt`` 和 ``%252e%252e/`` 都会还原为原始签名。"

#: ../../index.rst:275
msgid ""
"An 8 KiB body scans in 12,784.3 ns, about 1.56 ns per byte. An operator "
"may audit a category rather than enforce it, so that its findings are "
"logged but not acted on. A field must then be judged per category, so "
"that an audited finding cannot hide an enforced one. Rather than scanning "
"the field once per category, Sibuna scans it once for the set of "
"categories whose signatures occur, and then searches only the wanted "
"categories among them; the same 8 KiB body with SQL injection audited "
"takes 15,485.4 ns [#waf-cost]_. Shield remains a bounded heuristic "
"inspector, not a full SQL or HTML parser, and bytes beyond the inspection "
"bound are not inspected."
msgstr ""
"一个 8 KiB 的请求体扫描耗时 12,784.3 ns，约合每字节 1.56 "
"ns。运维人员可以对某个类别只审计而不强制执行，此时它的检出结果只记录，不处置。这样一来，字段就必须按类别分别判定，以免一个被审计的检出结果掩盖一个需要强制执行的结果。Sibuna "
"并不对每个类别各扫描一遍字段，而是只扫描一遍，找出其签名出现过的类别集合，再只在其中搜索需要的类别；同样的 8 KiB 请求体在 SQL "
"注入设为审计时耗时 15,485.4 ns [#waf-cost]_。Shield 仍然是一个有界的启发式检查器，而不是完整的 SQL 或 "
"HTML 解析器；超出检查范围的字节不会被检查。"

#: ../../index.rst:277
msgid "TLS Fingerprints From the Ingress"
msgstr "来自入口代理的 TLS 指纹"

#: ../../index.rst:280
msgid ""
"A User-Agent is a string that any client may write as it likes. A JA4 "
"fingerprint is harder to forge. It summarises how a client opens a TLS "
"connection: protocol, version, cipher suites, extensions and the first "
"ALPN value. The client's TLS library fixes these before the first HTTP "
"byte is sent. Only the component that terminates TLS sees the handshake, "
"so only it can compute JA4. Sibuna terminates no inbound TLS, so it does "
"not compute JA4. It reads the fingerprint that a trusted ingress computed "
"and forwarded in a request header, named with ``--ja4-header`` [#ja4]_."
msgstr ""
"User-Agent 是任何客户端都可以随意填写的字符串。JA4 指纹则更难伪造。它概括了客户端建立 TLS "
"连接的方式：协议、版本、密码套件、扩展和第一个 ALPN 值。客户端的 TLS 库在发送第一个 HTTP 字节之前就已确定了这些内容。只有终止 "
"TLS 的组件能看到握手，因此只有它能计算 JA4。Sibuna 不终止任何入站 TLS，所以它不计算 "
"JA4，而是读取受信任的入口代理计算后在请求头中转发的指纹，请求头名称由 ``--ja4-header`` 指定 [#ja4]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:282
msgid ""
"*Trust.* The header is read only when forwarded headers are trusted, by "
"the decision that governs ``X-Forwarded-For``. From an untrusted peer it "
"is ignored, and in reverse-proxy mode every copy of it is removed before "
"the request reaches the origin."
msgstr ""
"*信任。* 只有在信任转发头时才读取该请求头，这一判断与决定是否信任 ``X-Forwarded-For`` "
"的判断相同。来自不受信任对端的该请求头会被忽略；在反向代理模式下，请求到达源站之前，它的所有副本都会被移除。"

#: ../../index.rst:283
msgid ""
"*Validation.* A value is accepted only in the 36-byte JA4 form, and only "
"when exactly one field of that name is present. A malformed or repeated "
"value is treated as absent and counted."
msgstr "*校验。* 只有 36 字节 JA4 格式的值才会被接受，并且必须恰好只有一个同名字段。格式错误或重复的值被视为不存在，并计数。"

#: ../../index.rst:284
msgid ""
"*Policy.* A rule matches a whole fingerprint, or a prefix followed by "
"``*``; a request without a fingerprint never matches such a rule. "
"Matching is a byte comparison, and the warm request path still makes no "
"heap allocation."
msgstr ""
"*策略。* 规则匹配完整的指纹，或匹配后跟 ``*`` "
"的前缀；没有指纹的请求永远不会匹配这样的规则。匹配只是字节比较，预热后的请求路径仍然不做任何堆分配。"

#: ../../index.rst:285
msgid ""
"*Records.* Incidents store the fingerprint of their request, and the "
"console shows it in the incident evidence and filters events by it. Bans "
"and reputation stay keyed by address, because many legitimate clients "
"share one TLS library."
msgstr ""
"*记录。* 事件保存其请求的指纹，控制台在事件证据中显示它，并可以按它筛选事件。封禁和信誉仍然以地址为键，因为许多合法客户端共用同一个 TLS 库。"

#: ../../index.rst:289
msgid "Keyed Hashing and the Security Review"
msgstr "带密钥哈希与安全审查"

#: ../../index.rst:292
msgid ""
"An adversarial review of the request path in October 2026 found "
"weaknesses in mechanisms we had considered settled. We fixed each one and "
"recorded the fix in the design record of the mechanism [#security]_."
msgstr ""
"2026 年 10 月，一次针对请求路径的对抗性审查发现了我们原以为已经定型的机制中的弱点。我们逐一修复，并把修复记录在相应机制的设计记录中 "
"[#security]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:294
msgid ""
"*Predictable table placement.* The limiter and the ban table placed keys "
"with a hash under seeds written in the source, so anyone could compute "
"addresses that share a victim's probe window. Placement now uses "
"SipHash-1-3 under a key drawn from operating-system randomness, and each "
"table derives its own key. The daemon hashes the client once per request "
"(8.7 ns) and passes the hash to every table; the store path of a request "
"fell from 43 to 26 ns."
msgstr ""
"*可预测的表内放置。* 限制器和封禁表原先用写在源代码中的种子计算哈希来放置键，因此任何人都能算出与受害者共用同一探测窗口的地址。现在，放置使用 "
"SipHash-1-3，密钥取自操作系统的随机源，每张表派生自己的密钥。守护进程对每个请求只计算一次客户端哈希（8.7 "
"ns），并把哈希传给每张表；一个请求的存储路径从 43 ns 降到了 26 ns。"

#: ../../index.rst:295
msgid ""
"*Ban eviction.* A ban in effect is never evicted. When every slot a key "
"may take holds a live ban, the new ban is refused and counted, so a "
"banned client cannot evict its own ban."
msgstr ""
"*封禁驱逐。* "
"生效中的封禁永远不会被驱逐。当一个键可能占用的每个槽都持有有效的封禁时，新的封禁会被拒绝并计数，因此被封禁的客户端无法驱逐自己的封禁。"

#: ../../index.rst:296
msgid ""
"*Forwarded identity.* The leftmost ``X-Forwarded-For`` entry can be "
"written by the client. Sibuna takes the entry ``--trusted-hops`` "
"positions from the right, the one the nearest trusted proxy appended."
msgstr ""
"*转发的身份。* ``X-Forwarded-For`` 最左边的条目可以由客户端写入。Sibuna 取从右数第 "
"``--trusted-hops`` 个位置的条目，即最近的受信任代理所追加的那一项。"

#: ../../index.rst:297
msgid ""
"*Cookie tossing.* A request may carry several values of the session "
"cookie; the daemon tries up to eight, so a cookie planted by a sibling "
"domain cannot keep a visitor in a challenge loop."
msgstr ""
"*Cookie 投掷。* 一个请求可以携带会话 Cookie 的多个值；守护进程最多尝试八个，因此兄弟域名植入的 Cookie "
"无法让访问者陷入挑战循环。"

#: ../../index.rst:298
msgid ""
"*Spent-set capacity.* A table of 65,536 tags was exhausted by about 220 "
"verified solutions per second within a five-minute challenge lifetime, "
"after which honest solutions were refused. The capacity is now "
"configurable, 1,048,576 tags (24 MiB) by default."
msgstr ""
"*已用集合的容量。* 一张 65,536 个标签的表，在五分钟的挑战有效期内，只需每秒约 220 "
"个已验证的解答就会被耗尽，此后诚实的解答都会被拒绝。现在容量可以配置，默认为 1,048,576 个标签（24 MiB）。"

#: ../../index.rst:299
msgid ""
"*Adaptive difficulty.* The controller that raises the work under load now "
"counts verified solutions instead of issued challenges, which cost a "
"flooder nothing."
msgstr "*自适应难度。* 在负载下提高工作量的控制器现在统计的是已验证的解答，而不是已签发的挑战，因为后者对洪泛者毫无成本。"

#: ../../index.rst:301
msgid ""
"Keyed placement has a price, and we pay it once per request rather than "
"once per table. A limiter check that hashes raw client bytes itself takes "
"12.8 ns; the check on a hashed client, the path the daemon uses, takes "
"6.2 ns. Because the limiter and the spent set are allocated zeroed, idle "
"tables are not resident, so their configured capacity costs no memory "
"until it is used."
msgstr ""
"带密钥放置是有代价的，而我们每个请求只付一次，而不是每张表付一次。由限制器自己对原始客户端字节计算哈希的检查耗时 12.8 "
"ns；对已算好哈希的客户端做检查（守护进程实际走的路径）耗时 6.2 "
"ns。由于限制器和已用集合以清零的内存分配，空闲的表不会驻留在内存中，因此配置的容量在被使用之前不占用内存。"

#: ../../index.rst:305
msgid "Proofs of Work: Parallel Search and Sequential Work"
msgstr "工作量证明：并行搜索与顺序工作"

#: ../../index.rst:308
msgid "The Hashcash Tier"
msgstr "Hashcash 层"

#: ../../index.rst:311
msgid ""
"The first tier is Hashcash at bit granularity. For a challenge string "
":math:`C` and difficulty :math:`b`, the client finds a nonce :math:`N` "
"such that :math:`\\text{SHA-256}(C \\parallel \\texttt{\":\"} \\parallel "
"\\mathrm{dec}(N))` has :math:`b` leading zero bits. The decimal rendering "
"of the nonce keeps the wire format identical between the WebAssembly "
"solver, the JavaScript fallback and the native verifier. For ideal "
"digests the number of trials :math:`K` is geometric with :math:`p = "
"2^{-b}`:"
msgstr ""
"第一层是比特粒度的 Hashcash。对于挑战字符串 :math:`C` 和难度 :math:`b`，客户端寻找一个 nonce "
":math:`N`，使 :math:`\\text{SHA-256}(C \\parallel \\texttt{\":\"} "
"\\parallel \\mathrm{dec}(N))` 具有 :math:`b` 个前导零比特。nonce 以十进制表示，使 "
"WebAssembly 求解器、JavaScript 后备实现和原生验证器之间的线路格式完全一致。对于理想的摘要，尝试次数 :math:`K` "
"服从 :math:`p = 2^{-b}` 的几何分布："

#: ../../index.rst:313
msgid ""
"P(K > k) = (1 - p)^k, \\qquad E[K] = 2^b, \\qquad \\mathrm{median}(K) "
"\\approx 2^b \\ln 2."
msgstr ""
"P(K > k) = (1 - p)^k, \\qquad E[K] = 2^b, \\qquad \\mathrm{median}(K) "
"\\approx 2^b \\ln 2."

#: ../../index.rst:317
msgid ""
"Search has two limits. Its variance is large, so one slow solve is not a "
"broken worker. And independent trials run in parallel, so a sender with "
"more cores finishes sooner, even though the expected total work is the "
"same [#hashcash]_."
msgstr ""
"搜索有两个局限。它的方差很大，所以一次缓慢的求解并不说明 worker "
"出了故障。而且各次独立尝试可以并行进行，因此核心更多的发送方完成得更快，尽管期望的总工作量相同 [#hashcash]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:319
msgid "The Sequential-Work Tier"
msgstr "顺序工作层"

#: ../../index.rst:322
msgid ""
"The second tier follows the proof of sequential work of Cohen and "
"Pietrzak (EUROCRYPT 2018). Its labels form a complete binary tree of "
"depth :math:`n`. An internal node hashes its two children. A leaf hashes "
"the *left siblings of its ancestors* wherever its root path turned right. "
"Those left-sibling edges make the computation sequential: a leaf cannot "
"be labelled until every subtree to its left is complete, so the root "
"label depends on all :math:`2^{n+1} - 1` labels in order. After computing "
"the root :math:`\\varphi`, the prover derives :math:`t` leaves by "
"Fiat-Shamir and, for each, sends the leaf label and the :math:`n` sibling "
"labels along its path. The verifier recomputes each opened leaf and "
"hashes up to :math:`\\varphi`, at a cost of :math:`O(tn)` label "
"computations in a fixed workspace."
msgstr ""
"第二层采用 Cohen 和 Pietrzak 的顺序工作量证明（EUROCRYPT 2018）。它的标签构成一棵深度为 :math:`n` "
"的完全二叉树。内部节点对其两个子节点做哈希。叶子则在其通往根的路径每次向右转的地方，对 *祖先的左兄弟* "
"做哈希。正是这些左兄弟边使计算成为顺序的：一个叶子必须等它左边的每棵子树都完成之后才能计算标签，因此根标签按顺序依赖于全部 "
":math:`2^{n+1} - 1` 个标签。算出根 :math:`\\varphi` 之后，证明者用 Fiat-Shamir 推导出 "
":math:`t` 个叶子，并为每个叶子发送叶子标签及其路径上的 :math:`n` 个兄弟标签。验证者重新计算每个被揭示的叶子，再逐层哈希直到 "
":math:`\\varphi`，代价为在固定工作区内计算 :math:`O(tn)` 个标签。"

#: ../../index.rst:324
msgid ""
"Left, four cores each try a disjoint share of the nonces, and core 3 "
"finds one at nonce 18, after which every core stops. Right, a binary tree "
"of depth three. The path of leaf 3.5 is amber, the siblings 1.0, 2.3 and "
"3.4 sent in its opening are green, and dashed red arrows run from 1.0 and "
"3.4 into leaf 3.5."
msgstr ""
"左图：四个核心各自尝试互不相交的一部分 nonce，核心 3 在 nonce 18 处找到解，随后所有核心都停止。右图：一棵深度为三的二叉树。叶子 "
"3.5 的路径为琥珀色，它的揭示中发送的兄弟节点 1.0、2.3 和 3.4 为绿色，红色虚线箭头从 1.0 和 3.4 指向叶子 3.5。"

#: ../../index.rst:327
msgid ""
"Parallel search against sequential work. Left, Hashcash: independent "
"nonce trials, so :math:`M` cores finish about :math:`M` times sooner. "
"Right, the Cohen-Pietrzak tree at depth 3: the dashed left-sibling edges "
"make leaf 3.5 wait for the subtrees to its left, and an opening of leaf "
"3.5 sends its label and the three green siblings (after book Part III)."
msgstr ""
"并行搜索与顺序工作的对比。左图为 Hashcash：各次 nonce 尝试相互独立，因此 :math:`M` 个核心大约快 :math:`M` "
"倍完成。右图为深度 3 的 Cohen-Pietrzak 树：虚线表示的左兄弟边使叶子 3.5 必须等待其左边的子树完成；揭示叶子 3.5 "
"时，发送它的标签和三个绿色的兄弟节点（据《Sibuna 之书》第 III 部分）。"

#: ../../index.rst:329
msgid ""
"The parameters are chosen so that the numbers stay small. Work bits map "
"to depth by :math:`n = b - 3`, clamped to :math:`[4, 24]`. A proof has "
":math:`32(1 + t(n+1))` bytes, which at depth 13 with 16 openings is "
":math:`32(1 + 16 \\times 14) = 7200` bytes. The prover keeps only the top "
"levels of the tree and recomputes the subtree it must open, so its whole "
"workspace, the proof included, stays under 100 KB; a browser tab and the "
"native tests use the same prover [#posw]_. Blocki, Lee and Zhou (ITC "
"2021) proved the construction sound against quantum provers in the "
"quantum random-oracle model."
msgstr ""
"参数的选择让数字保持很小。工作比特按 :math:`n = b - 3` 映射为深度，并限制在 :math:`[4, 24]` 之内。一个证明有 "
":math:`32(1 + t(n+1))` 字节，在深度 13、16 次揭示时为 :math:`32(1 + 16 \\times 14) = "
"7200` 字节。证明者只保留树的顶部几层，并重新计算它必须揭示的子树，因此包括证明在内的整个工作区都不超过 100 "
"KB；浏览器标签页和原生测试使用同一个证明者 [#posw]_。Blocki、Lee 和 Zhou（ITC "
"2021）在量子随机预言机模型中证明了该构造对量子证明者也是可靠的。"

#: ../../index.rst:331
msgid ""
"We should be careful about what this establishes. The security results "
"hold under the random-oracle assumptions of the papers, for the "
"constructions and bounds they state. They are not an independent audit of "
"our concrete SHA-256 protocol, its parameter mapping or its browser "
"timing. The elementary sampling bound :math:`(1-\\alpha)^t`, the chance "
"that :math:`t` independent openings all miss a fixed bad fraction "
":math:`\\alpha`, explains why more openings help; it is not by itself a "
"proof against a prover who grinds many roots. We make no unconditional "
"claim that cheating is never cheaper."
msgstr ""
"我们应当谨慎看待这些结果究竟证明了什么。这些安全性结果在相关论文的随机预言机假设下成立，适用于论文所陈述的构造和界。它们并不是对我们具体的 "
"SHA-256 协议、参数映射或浏览器耗时的独立审计。初等的抽样界 :math:`(1-\\alpha)^t`，即 :math:`t` "
"次独立揭示全部错过一个固定的坏比例 :math:`\\alpha` "
"的概率，解释了为什么更多的揭示有帮助；但它本身并不能防御一个反复尝试大量根的证明者。我们不作“作弊永远不会更便宜”这样的无条件断言。"

#: ../../index.rst:333
msgid "The Round Trip and the Session"
msgstr "往返流程与会话"

#: ../../index.rst:336
msgid ""
"A navigation without a valid session receives the interstitial page, "
"which carries a *requirement ticket*: the challenge this decision demands "
"(algorithm, work bits, openings) and the rule's hash, sealed for this "
"client and valid for one challenge lifetime. The page fetches its "
"challenge with the ticket, so the work is fixed by the decision that "
"demanded it. A Web Worker solves the challenge with the WebAssembly "
"prover, or with a JavaScript fallback where WebAssembly is unavailable, "
"and posts the answer. On success the server sets a session cookie of 75 "
"characters, bound by a keyed fingerprint to the client's address and "
"User-Agent, and the page reloads. The prover in the browser is compiled "
"from the same source as the server's verifier, so the two cannot drift "
"apart [#round-trip]_."
msgstr ""
"没有有效会话的导航请求会收到验证中间页，页中携带一张 "
"*要求票据*：本次决策所要求的挑战（算法、工作比特、揭示数）和规则的哈希，为该客户端封装，在一个挑战有效期内有效。页面凭票据获取挑战，因此工作量由提出要求的那次决策确定。Web "
"Worker 用 WebAssembly 证明器求解挑战（在 WebAssembly 不可用时改用 JavaScript "
"后备实现），然后提交答案。成功后，服务器设置一个 75 个字符的会话 Cookie，它通过带密钥的指纹与客户端的地址和 User-Agent "
"绑定，随后页面重新加载。浏览器中的证明器与服务器的验证器由同一份源代码编译而成，因此两者不会逐渐偏离 [#round-trip]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:338
msgid "What Verification Costs"
msgstr "验证的成本"

#: ../../index.rst:341
msgid ""
"Both tiers are bound by SHA-256, and Sibuna selects the processor's SHA "
"instructions at run time where they exist, so one binary is fast on every "
"machine that has them. Hashcash verification at 16 bits takes 70.2 ns, "
"and verifying a depth-13 proof with 16 openings takes 22,272.4 ns. The "
"browser prover is a WebAssembly module of 14,744 bytes. In the end-to-end "
"browser check, headless Chromium solved the interstitial's challenge in "
"29 to 34 ms with WebAssembly and in 84 to 91 ms with the JavaScript "
"fallback [#verify-cost]_. The primitive suite measures verification only; "
"a native timing does not stand for a browser's solve time."
msgstr ""
"两层的耗时都取决于 SHA-256；Sibuna 在运行时选用处理器的 SHA "
"指令（如果有的话），因此同一个可执行文件在每台具备这些指令的机器上都很快。16 比特的 Hashcash 验证耗时 70.2 ns，验证一个深度 "
"13、16 次揭示的证明耗时 22,272.4 ns。浏览器证明器是一个 14,744 字节的 WebAssembly "
"模块。在端到端浏览器检查中，无头 Chromium 求解验证中间页的挑战，使用 WebAssembly 时耗时 29 到 34 ms，使用 "
"JavaScript 后备实现时耗时 84 到 91 ms "
"[#verify-cost]_。原语测试套件只测量验证；原生环境下的耗时不能代表浏览器的求解时间。"

#: ../../index.rst:343
msgid ""
"Sessions use a symmetric token. The verifier is the issuer, or a cluster "
"that shares one seed, so a keyed pseudorandom function supplies exactly "
"the authentication needed. A keyed-BLAKE3 token verifies in 155.8 ns and "
"an Ed25519 token in 40,587.5 ns, so one signature verification costs "
"about as much as 260 MAC verifications. There is a second reason for the "
"choice: Shor's algorithm breaks the discrete logarithms beneath Ed25519, "
"while against a keyed hash quantum search gives at most a quadratic "
"speedup. Ed25519 remains an option for deployments that need verifiers "
"who cannot mint tokens."
msgstr ""
"会话使用对称令牌。验证者就是签发者，或者是共享同一个种子的集群，因此带密钥的伪随机函数恰好提供所需的认证。带密钥 BLAKE3 令牌的验证耗时 "
"155.8 ns，Ed25519 令牌耗时 40,587.5 ns，一次签名验证的成本约等于 260 次 MAC "
"验证。选择对称令牌还有第二个理由：Shor 算法能攻破 Ed25519 "
"所依赖的离散对数，而对带密钥哈希，量子搜索至多带来平方级加速。对于需要验证者无法签发令牌的部署，Ed25519 仍是一个可选项。"

#: ../../index.rst:345
msgid "Shared State Without a Consensus Protocol of Our Own"
msgstr "无需自研共识协议的共享状态"

#: ../../index.rst:348
msgid ""
"Lamport on Distributed Invariants: Safety, Liveness, and Who Owns the Log"
msgstr "兰波特谈分布式不变量：安全性、活性，以及谁拥有日志"

#: ../../index.rst:350
msgid ""
"In 1987 Leslie Lamport described a distributed system as one in which the "
"failure of a computer you did not even know existed can render your own "
"computer unusable. Read as advice, it asks us to count the computers we "
"depend on, and to state what must hold when any of them fails. Two kinds "
"of statement are enough. *Safety*: nothing bad ever happens, for example "
"a node never acts on a policy that no committed transaction wrote. "
"*Liveness*: something good eventually happens, for example a node that "
"can reach the database eventually serves the latest policy. A consensus "
"protocol is a beautiful way to obtain both. It is also a large thing to "
"own, and the question for a firewall is not whether consensus is good but "
"who should maintain the log."
msgstr ""
"1987 "
"年，莱斯利·兰波特这样描述分布式系统：在这种系统中，一台你甚至不知道其存在的计算机出了故障，就能让你自己的计算机无法使用。把它当作忠告来读，它要求我们清点自己依赖的计算机，并说明其中任何一台出故障时必须成立的性质。两类陈述就够了。*安全性*：坏事永远不会发生，例如节点永远不会依据一个没有任何已提交事务写入过的策略行事。*活性*：好事最终会发生，例如能连上数据库的节点最终会采用最新的策略。共识协议是同时获得这两者的一种优美方式。它也是一个需要长期维护的庞大系统；对防火墙来说，问题不在于共识好不好，而在于应该由谁来维护日志。"

#: ../../index.rst:352
msgid "Why SQL, and Why Not a Consensus Protocol of Our Own"
msgstr "为什么用 SQL，为什么不自研共识协议"

#: ../../index.rst:355
msgid ""
"Sibuna stores little: a few hundred policy rows, a reputation table, and "
"forensic incidents that operators also export to other systems. That "
"state does not need a bespoke replicated engine. It needs a reliable SQL "
"store, local for one node and shared for many. A single node therefore "
"keeps its state in an embedded SQLite file in its data directory, in WAL "
"mode, and a cluster points every node at one PostgreSQL database "
"[#zaxonlite]_."
msgstr ""
"Sibuna "
"存储的东西不多：几百行策略、一张信誉表，以及运维人员也会导出到其他系统的取证事件。这些状态不需要专门定制的复制引擎。它需要的是一个可靠的 SQL "
"存储，单个节点用本地的，多个节点用共享的。因此，单个节点把状态保存在其数据目录中的一个嵌入式 SQLite 文件里（WAL "
"模式），集群则让每个节点都指向同一个 PostgreSQL 数据库 [#zaxonlite]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:357
msgid ""
"We chose not to run a consensus protocol inside the firewall. A consensus "
"engine is a large system to own beside a firewall, with its own formats "
"and its own failure modes, and it adds work to shutdown and to every "
"upgrade. The availability and replication of a cluster's state are "
"instead PostgreSQL's concern, served by its streaming replication and "
"failover tools or by a managed service. We think this is the humbler "
"choice: PostgreSQL's replication has been exercised by far more "
"deployments than ours could be, and Sibuna's write rate (batched "
"incidents and rare policy changes) is small enough that one primary is "
"not a bottleneck."
msgstr ""
"我们选择不在防火墙内部运行共识协议。共识引擎是一个要在防火墙之外另行维护的庞大系统，有它自己的格式和故障模式，还会给关停和每次升级增加工作。集群状态的可用性和复制改由 "
"PostgreSQL 负责，借助其流复制和故障切换工具或托管服务来实现。我们认为这是更谦逊的选择：PostgreSQL "
"的复制经受过的部署远比我们的多，而 Sibuna 的写入速率（分批写入的事件和少有的策略变更）足够低，一个主库不会成为瓶颈。"

#: ../../index.rst:359
msgid ""
"Storage also stays optional. Without ``--data-dir`` or ``--database-url`` "
"the daemon is an in-memory firewall whose policies come from a file."
msgstr ""
"存储也仍然是可选的。不使用 ``--data-dir`` 或 ``--database-url`` 时，守护进程是一个纯内存的防火墙，策略来自文件。"

#: ../../index.rst:361
msgid "One Storage Thread"
msgstr "单一存储线程"

#: ../../index.rst:364
msgid ""
"One storage thread owns the database connections; nothing else touches "
"SQL. Request threads never wait on it. They push incident records into a "
"bounded ring of 512 slots, which drops and counts a record when it is "
"full, and they read the published engine. Every 500 ms by default the "
"storage thread runs one tick: it writes up to 32 queued incidents in one "
"transaction, reads the policy revision and, when it changed, rebuilds the "
"engine and publishes it. A rebuild reads the revision before and after "
"loading; if a writer committed in between, the candidate is discarded and "
"the old engine stays live. Operators may write the policy tables "
"directly: triggers advance the revision in the writer's transaction, and "
"under PostgreSQL a ``NOTIFY`` lets nodes tick at once, while polling "
"remains the guarantee [#storage-thread]_."
msgstr ""
"一个存储线程拥有所有数据库连接；其他任何部分都不接触 SQL。请求线程从不等待它。请求线程把事件记录推入一个有 512 "
"个槽的有界环形缓冲区（缓冲区满时丢弃记录并计数），并读取已发布的引擎。存储线程默认每 500 ms 运行一个节拍：在一个事务中写入最多 32 "
"个排队的事件，读取策略修订版本，如果版本有变，就重建并发布引擎。重建时会在加载前后各读一次修订版本；如果期间有写者提交，就丢弃这个候选引擎，旧引擎继续生效。运维人员可以直接写策略表：触发器在写者的事务中推进修订版本；在 "
"PostgreSQL 下，``NOTIFY`` 让各节点立即执行节拍，而轮询仍然是最终的保证 [#storage-thread]_。"

#: ../../index.rst:367
msgid ""
"An ingress sends traffic to three Sibuna nodes. In each node, connection "
"threads read a published engine and push incidents into a bounded ring; a "
"storage thread drains the ring, writes batches and rebuilds the engine. "
"All three storage threads connect to one PostgreSQL primary, optionally "
"over TLS with verify-full. The primary replicates to a standby by "
"streaming replication, which the operator runs."
msgstr ""
"一个入口代理把流量发给三个 Sibuna "
"节点。在每个节点中，连接线程读取已发布的引擎，并把事件推入一个有界环形缓冲区；存储线程排空环形缓冲区，分批写入并重建引擎。三个存储线程都连接到同一个 "
"PostgreSQL 主库，可选地使用 verify-full 模式的 TLS。主库通过流复制把数据复制到一个备库，复制由运维人员负责运行。"

